(335583, 25389, 6025, '<td valign="top">Hmm. I think maybe the topic of this title is a bit off-key. To me, it seems as if you are criticising him. I assume you know little about him, which means that you have taken a picture that could have been strong and emotional, and turned it into a political minefield by your title.<br/> <br/>Apart from that, it seems as if the image is blorry and too much sharpened (if that makes sense).  <br/> <br/>Sorry. (4)</td>', 'Hmm. I think maybe the topic of this title is a bit off-key. To me, it seems as if you are criticising him. I assume you know little about him, which means that you have taken a picture that could have been strong and emotional, and turned it into a political minefield by your title. Apart from that, it seems as if the image is blorry and too much sharpened (if that makes sense).   Sorry. (4)', '2003-06-23 11:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(335586, 25851, 6025, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but the shadows are rather confusing and the shadow does not quite seem to fit with the image itself. Very odd. Also a little too much noise and a little too burnt out for my taste. (4)</td>', 'A nice shot, but the shadows are rather confusing and the shadow does not quite seem to fit with the image itself. Very odd. Also a little too much noise and a little too burnt out for my taste. (4)', '2003-06-23 11:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
