(335784, 25612, 3080, '<td valign="top">This cracks me up.  I think you did an excellent job getting this shot.  I don''t know what they look like directly, but the focus does seem a little soft, however, I realize that this is a tough shot to get.  What a perfect smiley though.</td>', 'This cracks me up.  I think you did an excellent job getting this shot.  I don''t know what they look like directly, but the focus does seem a little soft, however, I realize that this is a tough shot to get.  What a perfect smiley though.', '2003-06-23 18:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(335792, 25976, 1041, '<td valign="top">I love it!  The texture and clarity is wonderful.  Love the shallow DOF, too.  Wouldn''t mind seeing just a bit more detail of the tools, but that''s such a nitpick.  One of my favorites so far this challenge.</td>', 'I love it!  The texture and clarity is wonderful.  Love the shallow DOF, too.  Wouldn''t mind seeing just a bit more detail of the tools, but that''s such a nitpick.  One of my favorites so far this challenge.', '2003-06-23 18:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(335796, 25962, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow ... how did you do that?  Double-exposure?  I like how the crucial parts of the guitar player are in focus and the rest is a blur of lights.  Not sure how well this will go down on DPC, but I think it''s a fantastic entry :)</td>', 'Wow ... how did you do that?  Double-exposure?  I like how the crucial parts of the guitar player are in focus and the rest is a blur of lights.  Not sure how well this will go down on DPC, but I think it''s a fantastic entry :)', '2003-06-23 18:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(335798, 25967, 1041, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  I like that she''s smiling while she''s working.  Beautiful worn knife, great focus on the meat she''s chopping and her with unobtrusive background.  There''s nothing I would change.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  I like that she''s smiling while she''s working.  Beautiful worn knife, great focus on the meat she''s chopping and her with unobtrusive background.  There''s nothing I would change.', '2003-06-23 18:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(335801, 25984, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an emotional portrait.  The skinny outstretched arm and her worn face are so contrasted by the bright and happy colors.  A wonderful portrait of a sad situation.  The only thing I''d change (and I know that it isn''t possible within the current challenge guidelines so no point deduction) is the text in the top left corner, make it the same color as the rest of the wall.  You might have a winner here ...</td>', 'Wow, what an emotional portrait.  The skinny outstretched arm and her worn face are so contrasted by the bright and happy colors.  A wonderful portrait of a sad situation.  The only thing I''d change (and I know that it isn''t possible within the current challenge guidelines so no point deduction) is the text in the top left corner, make it the same color as the rest of the wall.  You might have a winner here ...', '2003-06-23 18:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(335860, 25827, 7763, '<td valign="top">gross, it this is supposed to be a dentist he might want to clean under his fingernails.</td>', 'gross, it this is supposed to be a dentist he might want to clean under his fingernails.', '2003-06-23 19:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
