(335877, 25976, 8701, '<td valign="top">really amazing, the dirt on his hands is tough, and the dof was well done, and the light from the back really tops it off. my only critisism is that maybe if you would have zoomed out and also had gotten the arms of this man into the photo, it might have been better. 8</td>', 'really amazing, the dirt on his hands is tough, and the dof was well done, and the light from the back really tops it off. my only critisism is that maybe if you would have zoomed out and also had gotten the arms of this man into the photo, it might have been better. 8', '2003-06-23 20:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
