(336020, 25980, 3936, '<td valign="top">Good pic!  Tiny bit washed out at the trees(?) at lower left.  Would like to see the end of the rod, rather than have it lead me off page, but a good strong 9 none the less.  Update:  After finishing voting, this is my pick for the week,  now 10.</td>', 'Good pic!  Tiny bit washed out at the trees(?) at lower left.  Would like to see the end of the rod, rather than have it lead me off page, but a good strong 9 none the less.  Update:  After finishing voting, this is my pick for the week,  now 10.', '2003-06-24 00:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(336027, 25653, 8953, '<td valign="top">Great shot! A bit on the tricky side? I would have had to gone at this with different f stops and shutter speeds 20 times, this is one of my favorites 9</td>', 'Great shot! A bit on the tricky side? I would have had to gone at this with different f stops and shutter speeds 20 times, this is one of my favorites 9', '2003-06-24 01:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
