(336058, 25928, 7994, '<td valign="top">This looks like Russia.  I like the composition.  However I find the decoration lights a bit distracting.</td>', 'This looks like Russia.  I like the composition.  However I find the decoration lights a bit distracting.', '2003-06-24 02:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
