(336080, 25845, 2110, '<td valign="top">I guess this is widest your camera could give..nice shot under the given circumstances..I would have liked to see atleast one of the humans intact!</td>', 'I guess this is widest your camera could give..nice shot under the given circumstances..I would have liked to see atleast one of the humans intact!', '2003-06-24 03:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
