(338061, 25851, 8488, '<td valign="top">I really wish it weren''t so grainy. This could easily be a 9 from me; but all those speckles all over it are distracting. :-/ Still, 8 on concept, composition, abstract shape, and lovely shadow work.</td>', 'I really wish it weren''t so grainy. This could easily be a 9 from me; but all those speckles all over it are distracting. :-/ Still, 8 on concept, composition, abstract shape, and lovely shadow work.', '2003-06-25 16:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(338063, 25612, 8488, '<td valign="top">This is incredibly sweet, but I just can''t shoehorn it into the topic as much as I might try (since, among other things, people are explicitly mentioned, and there are no entire people in the shot).</td>', 'This is incredibly sweet, but I just can''t shoehorn it into the topic as much as I might try (since, among other things, people are explicitly mentioned, and there are no entire people in the shot).', '2003-06-25 16:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(338087, 25906, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture of Toronto, I\''d love to live this close to the water.  Like the composition, too, overall, the photo appears ever so slightly soft and a little overexposed (especially the white dome).  You must have a DSLR because you have a couple of dirtspecs in the sky ... easy to clone out after the challenge, so no points deducted for that.  I don\''t think you are really meeting the challenge (a person or group of people doing what they do for a living), sorry.</td>', 'Wonderful picture of Toronto, I\''d love to live this close to the water.  Like the composition, too, overall, the photo appears ever so slightly soft and a little overexposed (especially the white dome).  You must have a DSLR because you have a couple of dirtspecs in the sky ... easy to clone out after the challenge, so no points deducted for that.  I don\''t think you are really meeting the challenge (a person or group of people doing what they do for a living), sorry.', '2003-06-25 16:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(338120, 25871, 2891, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the email.  I am glad I can vote on the techincal more accurately.  I still think you should try opening aperture more and decrease shutter speed as you could catch movement of arm that way as well...</td>', 'Thanks for the email.  I am glad I can vote on the techincal more accurately.  I still think you should try opening aperture more and decrease shutter speed as you could catch movement of arm that way as well...', '2003-06-25 17:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
