(339753, 25957, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice job!</td>', 'Nice job!', '2003-06-27 01:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(339757, 25519, 8682, '<td valign="top">what a great invent the post it!!!!</td>', 'what a great invent the post it!!!!', '2003-06-27 01:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(339758, 25977, 554, '<td valign="top">nice angle......and frame</td>', 'nice angle......and frame', '2003-06-27 01:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(339768, 25984, 326, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2003-06-27 02:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(339785, 25958, 326, '<td valign="top">Yep that''s strange....lol</td>', 'Yep that''s strange....lol', '2003-06-27 02:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(339788, 25602, 4514, '<td valign="top">Ok.  So do not tell me.  You are going to spin that down then try to Culture it right???  My respect goes out to you my friend.</td>', 'Ok.  So do not tell me.  You are going to spin that down then try to Culture it right???  My respect goes out to you my friend.', '2003-06-27 02:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(340189, 25817, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.  The girl in the middle looks like she is being attacked by both the wedding coordinator and bride to be.  Is this what really happens at weddings?  I really don''t know, I heard they can be stressful:)  Nice photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the lighting.  The girl in the middle looks like she is being attacked by both the wedding coordinator and bride to be.  Is this what really happens at weddings?  I really don''t know, I heard they can be stressful:)  Nice photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-27 10:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(340382, 25851, 8171, '<td valign="top">I like this pose, tone and theme but not so crazy about the head-chop. BTW did you use slow synch flash? - 7</td>', 'I like this pose, tone and theme but not so crazy about the head-chop. BTW did you use slow synch flash? - 7', '2003-06-27 12:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(340385, 25987, 8171, '<td valign="top">Really like this - good composition and use of space - though I''m not sure I would have personally used so much white sky - 8</td>', 'Really like this - good composition and use of space - though I''m not sure I would have personally used so much white sky - 8', '2003-06-27 12:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(340389, 25613, 8171, '<td valign="top">Wow - striking composition and contrast though i''m thinking maybe straight monochrome would have looked better.  I have a close up rail shot myself that seemed to lose something when i tried sepia and I feel this might suffer the same.  Excellent effort all the same - 8</td>', 'Wow - striking composition and contrast though i''m thinking maybe straight monochrome would have looked better.  I have a close up rail shot myself that seemed to lose something when i tried sepia and I feel this might suffer the same.  Excellent effort all the same - 8', '2003-06-27 12:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(340390, 25960, 8171, '<td valign="top">I like this but the colour cast takes it down a little and mutes the effect of the red material.  Makes me wonder if it would look better in b and w - 7</td>', 'I like this but the colour cast takes it down a little and mutes the effect of the red material.  Makes me wonder if it would look better in b and w - 7', '2003-06-27 12:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(340392, 25957, 8171, '<td valign="top">Good work - nice, even exposure throughout and good composition- 8</td>', 'Good work - nice, even exposure throughout and good composition- 8', '2003-06-27 12:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(340394, 25970, 8171, '<td valign="top">I like the colours here but the suspended bucket takes it down as it looks as thought its about to engulf the old guy - good effort all the same - 7</td>', 'I like the colours here but the suspended bucket takes it down as it looks as thought its about to engulf the old guy - good effort all the same - 7', '2003-06-27 12:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(340397, 25871, 8171, '<td valign="top">I like the colours of his shirt and contrast against the back but it''s a shame we can''t see his face - 7</td>', 'I like the colours of his shirt and contrast against the back but it''s a shame we can''t see his face - 7', '2003-06-27 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(340406, 25881, 9604, '<td valign="top">Super shot!  Great composition and lighting!</td>', 'Super shot!  Great composition and lighting!', '2003-06-27 12:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(340409, 25892, 9604, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes and forms!  Might look real good processed as pure black and white.</td>', 'Interesting shapes and forms!  Might look real good processed as pure black and white.', '2003-06-27 12:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(340412, 25984, 9262, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and the contrast of her dark clothing and the red of the wall behind her. What I don''t like is her arm extending out of the frame. It''s too bad you couldn''t get her whole arem in. The black border is nice, but I''m not too sure about the red bit inside. Good job overall.</td>', 'I really like this shot and the contrast of her dark clothing and the red of the wall behind her. What I don''t like is her arm extending out of the frame. It''s too bad you couldn''t get her whole arem in. The black border is nice, but I''m not too sure about the red bit inside. Good job overall.', '2003-06-27 12:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(340413, 25827, 9262, '<td valign="top">Umm, close up dentristy. Fits the theme without actually showing someone at work. The lighting is a little bright.</td>', 'Umm, close up dentristy. Fits the theme without actually showing someone at work. The lighting is a little bright.', '2003-06-27 12:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(340414, 25613, 9604, '<td valign="top">Love the composition with a different shaped format. Seems a little "harsh".  Maybe needs to be a little "softer" focus.</td>', 'Love the composition with a different shaped format. Seems a little "harsh".  Maybe needs to be a little "softer" focus.', '2003-06-27 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(340415, 25875, 9262, '<td valign="top">I llike all of the rigging in this shot and the guy leaning watching the others clean the fish is nice. At first glance, it seems too busy, but on a closer study, I like the lines the rigging makes.</td>', 'I llike all of the rigging in this shot and the guy leaning watching the others clean the fish is nice. At first glance, it seems too busy, but on a closer study, I like the lines the rigging makes.', '2003-06-27 12:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(340417, 25653, 9604, '<td valign="top">A classic welding shot. A real tough exposure challenge...but you got it right!</td>', 'A classic welding shot. A real tough exposure challenge...but you got it right!', '2003-06-27 12:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(340419, 25979, 9262, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this earlier in the week, I could not figure out what they were doing and then I saw the tshirt that said "Fireworks" This is a nice shot of something that you don''t see every day (or at least I don''t!) The shadow in the foreground takes away from your shot.</td>', 'When I first saw this earlier in the week, I could not figure out what they were doing and then I saw the tshirt that said "Fireworks" This is a nice shot of something that you don''t see every day (or at least I don''t!) The shadow in the foreground takes away from your shot.', '2003-06-27 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(340423, 25985, 9262, '<td valign="top">Cute shot :) Nice expression on model''s face. A tad staged, but good overall. Lighting seems a little bright</td>', 'Cute shot :) Nice expression on model''s face. A tad staged, but good overall. Lighting seems a little bright', '2003-06-27 12:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(340424, 25906, 9262, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see this as fitting into the theme of this particular challenge. It is a nice landscape shot. Looks like it was taken on a nice sunny day.</td>', 'I don''t really see this as fitting into the theme of this particular challenge. It is a nice landscape shot. Looks like it was taken on a nice sunny day.', '2003-06-27 12:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(340427, 25929, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of this shot, but the multitude of bordesr is a little distracting. I think the B&amp;W fits your composition.</td>', 'I like the framing of this shot, but the multitude of bordesr is a little distracting. I think the B&W fits your composition.', '2003-06-27 12:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(340430, 25962, 9604, '<td valign="top">Very interesting study of lighting, color and motion!</td>', 'Very interesting study of lighting, color and motion!', '2003-06-27 12:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(340431, 25970, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like this shot with all of the colors and the busy background works for me. My only criticism is tthe large shadow running across one of your subjects in the foreground. Would be better without it, imho. Good job :)</td>', 'I like this shot with all of the colors and the busy background works for me. My only criticism is tthe large shadow running across one of your subjects in the foreground. Would be better without it, imho. Good job :)', '2003-06-27 12:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(340433, 25519, 9604, '<td valign="top">Dilbert and I both appreciate this shot!</td>', 'Dilbert and I both appreciate this shot!', '2003-06-27 12:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(340435, 25958, 9262, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of someone with an unusual job. I''m not sure the angle works. The lines of his body lead you to look at his feet. It would be better if taken from the oppoosite side so you were looking at his face.</td>', 'This is a nice shot of someone with an unusual job. I''m not sure the angle works. The lines of his body lead you to look at his feet. It would be better if taken from the oppoosite side so you were looking at his face.', '2003-06-27 12:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(340438, 25080, 9262, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this shot, I did not like the blurriness of the hand, but looking at it now I think the shot would have been boring and static without it. I like how the paper is cropped out of the frame as well. Nice angle &amp; perspective.</td>', 'When I first saw this shot, I did not like the blurriness of the hand, but looking at it now I think the shot would have been boring and static without it. I like how the paper is cropped out of the frame as well. Nice angle & perspective.', '2003-06-27 12:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(340440, 25961, 9262, '<td valign="top">This is a nice humourous shot. More contrast would be nice and the cropping of your model''s hands at the bottom of your composition is a little disctracting.</td>', 'This is a nice humourous shot. More contrast would be nice and the cropping of your model''s hands at the bottom of your composition is a little disctracting.', '2003-06-27 12:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(340443, 25511, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like how you have composted this shot. The men and the pipe form a nice trianlge of sorts arount the rule of thirds. The lighting is a little bright.</td>', 'I like how you have composted this shot. The men and the pipe form a nice trianlge of sorts arount the rule of thirds. The lighting is a little bright.', '2003-06-27 12:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(340445, 25976, 9604, '<td valign="top">Good shot! Good selective focus - great lighting!</td>', 'Good shot! Good selective focus - great lighting!', '2003-06-27 12:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(340447, 25924, 9262, '<td valign="top">Your subject is too centered and the composition is static.</td>', 'Your subject is too centered and the composition is static.', '2003-06-27 12:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(340450, 25957, 9262, '<td valign="top">This shot fits the challenge well and it''s a bonus that it''s not staged :) <br/>I like the repetition of all of the dishes being prepared and the gleaming stainless steel of the kitchen. Nice use of rule of thirds for your model. I would have liked to see it in color.</td>', 'This shot fits the challenge well and it''s a bonus that it''s not staged :) I like the repetition of all of the dishes being prepared and the gleaming stainless steel of the kitchen. Nice use of rule of thirds for your model. I would have liked to see it in color.', '2003-06-27 12:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(340451, 25878, 9604, '<td valign="top">Great color - good subject!  Would have been better with a little wider view.</td>', 'Great color - good subject!  Would have been better with a little wider view.', '2003-06-27 12:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(340452, 25475, 9262, '<td valign="top">I think the fence in the foreground ruins this one. I do like how you have framed your subkect with the earth mover though. Good attempt.</td>', 'I think the fence in the foreground ruins this one. I do like how you have framed your subkect with the earth mover though. Good attempt.', '2003-06-27 12:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(340457, 25434, 9604, '<td valign="top">You captured the reality of one of the toughest jobs!</td>', 'You captured the reality of one of the toughest jobs!', '2003-06-27 13:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(340458, 25982, 9262, '<td valign="top">The blurry foreground takes away from this shot. The focus on the three hole punch is nice. Background is very busy.</td>', 'The blurry foreground takes away from this shot. The focus on the three hole punch is nice. Background is very busy.', '2003-06-27 13:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(340462, 25763, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject. The lighting is a little bright and the girl''s skin tones are washed out.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject. The lighting is a little bright and the girl''s skin tones are washed out.', '2003-06-27 13:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(340463, 25948, 9262, '<td valign="top">I don''t like how you have cut out the subject on the left. The background is very busy and the angle of this shot doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I don''t like how you have cut out the subject on the left. The background is very busy and the angle of this shot doesn''t work for me.', '2003-06-27 13:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(340464, 25934, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping of this shot. Focus good, lighting good, failry interesting subject.</td>', 'I like the cropping of this shot. Focus good, lighting good, failry interesting subject.', '2003-06-27 13:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(340466, 25892, 9262, '<td valign="top">This shot sorta reminds me of the famous Iwo Jima statue. I don''t think that the structue in the lower right is necessary.</td>', 'This shot sorta reminds me of the famous Iwo Jima statue. I don''t think that the structue in the lower right is necessary.', '2003-06-27 13:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(340468, 25969, 9262, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a riveter before. It''s neat to see how it''s done. I would have liked to see more of the person doing the riveting and more of the machine itself.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a riveter before. It''s neat to see how it''s done. I would have liked to see more of the person doing the riveting and more of the machine itself.', '2003-06-27 13:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(340469, 25613, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the use of leading lines and negative space  but the lighting is very bright and makes everything look washed out.</td>', 'I like the use of leading lines and negative space  but the lighting is very bright and makes everything look washed out.', '2003-06-27 13:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(340472, 25881, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like how the lighting is falling on your subject. Spotlights are a good thing. With the lighting and the fog, it feels sorta ethereal, but the expression on his face is very mischevious.</td>', 'I like how the lighting is falling on your subject. Spotlights are a good thing. With the lighting and the fog, it feels sorta ethereal, but the expression on his face is very mischevious.', '2003-06-27 13:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(340474, 25817, 9262, '<td valign="top">Great shot, interesting subject matter, nice angle. Don''t like the border.</td>', 'Great shot, interesting subject matter, nice angle. Don''t like the border.', '2003-06-27 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(340476, 25320, 9262, '<td valign="top">Ow. I like how you have filled up the frame with your subject.</td>', 'Ow. I like how you have filled up the frame with your subject.', '2003-06-27 13:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(340479, 25612, 9262, '<td valign="top">Cute shot. Creative interpretation of theme. I wanna see a How''d they do that for this one.</td>', 'Cute shot. Creative interpretation of theme. I wanna see a How''d they do that for this one.', '2003-06-27 13:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(340480, 25534, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on your subject''s faces. The arms in the foreground are distracting. Lighting is bright and washes out some areas.</td>', 'I like the expression on your subject''s faces. The arms in the foreground are distracting. Lighting is bright and washes out some areas.', '2003-06-27 13:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(340490, 25851, 9262, '<td valign="top">A lot of shots in this challenge suffered from bad cropping but yours doesn''t! I like the shadow and the grainieness of this one. One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'A lot of shots in this challenge suffered from bad cropping but yours doesn''t! I like the shadow and the grainieness of this one. One of my favorites so far.', '2003-06-27 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(340492, 25950, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, composition and choice of subject. I like the concentration on your subjects face. Border doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Nice DOF, composition and choice of subject. I like the concentration on your subjects face. Border doesn''t work for me.', '2003-06-27 13:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(340493, 25845, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this one :) I also like how the bar curves in the middle of your shot. Doesn''t really show anyone at work, but it''s a good shot overall.</td>', 'I like the angle of this one :) I also like how the bar curves in the middle of your shot. Doesn''t really show anyone at work, but it''s a good shot overall.', '2003-06-27 13:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(340494, 25880, 9262, '<td valign="top">The fencing in the foreground is distracting and the background is very dark.</td>', 'The fencing in the foreground is distracting and the background is very dark.', '2003-06-27 13:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(340495, 25976, 9241, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot lots of "feel"</td>', 'Very nice shot lots of "feel"', '2003-06-27 13:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(340496, 25389, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like how the cement is framing your subject. Composition is a little too centered. Would be nice to see this one from a different angle, like facing the subject.</td>', 'I like how the cement is framing your subject. Composition is a little too centered. Would be nice to see this one from a different angle, like facing the subject.', '2003-06-27 13:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(340498, 25602, 9262, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! Looks like it could be on the cover of a magazine. One of my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent shot! Looks like it could be on the cover of a magazine. One of my favorites this challenge.', '2003-06-27 13:30:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(340500, 25950, 9241, '<td valign="top">Nice, maybe a little higher on the crop to avoid the arms of his chair</td>', 'Nice, maybe a little higher on the crop to avoid the arms of his chair', '2003-06-27 13:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(340501, 25434, 9241, '<td valign="top">I can feel the heat</td>', 'I can feel the heat', '2003-06-27 13:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(340502, 25927, 9262, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised we didn''t see more like this one in the challenge. Nice focus and color.</td>', 'I''m surprised we didn''t see more like this one in the challenge. Nice focus and color.', '2003-06-27 13:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(340504, 25980, 9262, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Love the silhouette. Very peaceful and the sunset is lovely.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Love the silhouette. Very peaceful and the sunset is lovely.', '2003-06-27 13:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(340505, 25948, 9241, '<td valign="top">very cluttered, I think showing the person working would have improved this shot</td>', 'very cluttered, I think showing the person working would have improved this shot', '2003-06-27 13:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(340506, 25653, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I really like how you have included all of your subject in your composition. There have been too many shots that just show hands working or an instrument of some kind.</td>', 'Nice shot! I really like how you have included all of your subject in your composition. There have been too many shots that just show hands working or an instrument of some kind.', '2003-06-27 13:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(340512, 25851, 9241, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, is it posterized?I like the shadow showing her head and the anonymity of cutting of her head</td>', 'Interesting effect, is it posterized?I like the shadow showing her head and the anonymity of cutting of her head', '2003-06-27 13:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(340518, 25434, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent photojournalism shot. 8</td>', 'Excellent photojournalism shot. 8', '2003-06-27 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(340519, 25980, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette against a nice clear sky. It would be good if you zoomed out a bit a think, and get the whole of the fishing rod in frame.</td>', 'Nice silhouette against a nice clear sky. It would be good if you zoomed out a bit a think, and get the whole of the fishing rod in frame.', '2003-06-27 13:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(340520, 25967, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. The tones and clarity are all really good. The meat or whatever it is she''s chopping tho seems a bit out of focus, and blown out.</td>', 'This is a great photo. The tones and clarity are all really good. The meat or whatever it is she''s chopping tho seems a bit out of focus, and blown out.', '2003-06-27 13:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(340521, 25973, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the duotone, and the lines all work well in this.</td>', 'I like the duotone, and the lines all work well in this.', '2003-06-27 13:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(340523, 25987, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think i would like this more if the person was looking into the frame rather than out of it, but other than that its a good composition, good tones, but it doesnt really look to me like doing work. Still a 7</td>', 'I think i would like this more if the person was looking into the frame rather than out of it, but other than that its a good composition, good tones, but it doesnt really look to me like doing work. Still a 7', '2003-06-27 13:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(340525, 25892, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the lines in this photo, the grey sky looks suitably gloomy to match the whole feel of the photo. 7</td>', 'I like the lines in this photo, the grey sky looks suitably gloomy to match the whole feel of the photo. 7', '2003-06-27 13:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(340526, 25927, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF you used, and the composition is very good. 7</td>', 'I like the DOF you used, and the composition is very good. 7', '2003-06-27 13:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(340528, 25976, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. Grreat range of tones, and different to most other shots in the challenge, as you have got up close and personal! I like it!</td>', 'Very nice photo. Grreat range of tones, and different to most other shots in the challenge, as you have got up close and personal! I like it!', '2003-06-27 13:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(340533, 25967, 9262, '<td valign="top">I really love the tones in this one. Nice emotion on your subjects face. The only thing is that the chicken is a little bright. Extremely well done.</td>', 'I really love the tones in this one. Nice emotion on your subjects face. The only thing is that the chicken is a little bright. Extremely well done.', '2003-06-27 14:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
