(340636, 25080, 5767, '<td valign="top">The lighting and exposure are nicely done here.  The motion in her hand is interesting because it doesn''t look like she''s writing, but that''s a small pick. Overall, well done.</td>', 'The lighting and exposure are nicely done here.  The motion in her hand is interesting because it doesn''t look like she''s writing, but that''s a small pick. Overall, well done.', '2003-06-27 14:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
