(340649, 25821, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superb composition, though I''d like the worker to be just a little lighter. I love how the lines and machinery dominate the image and show the worker to be so small a part of it all.</td>', 'Superb composition, though I''d like the worker to be just a little lighter. I love how the lines and machinery dominate the image and show the worker to be so small a part of it all.', '2003-06-27 14:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
