(340652, 25970, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is very communicative of the work they are doing. Colors work well for you here. Quite busy, but it goes to show them in this environment and is reality based, not ideal-based. If you catch my meaning....</td>', 'This is very communicative of the work they are doing. Colors work well for you here. Quite busy, but it goes to show them in this environment and is reality based, not ideal-based. If you catch my meaning....', '2003-06-27 15:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
