(340888, 25817, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite picture of this challenge.  The color and focus are exceptional.  I''m not really crazy about the angle, but that''s a nit/photographer''s preference.  I like how it seems the gloved handed woman is attempting to help.  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'This is my favorite picture of this challenge.  The color and focus are exceptional.  I''m not really crazy about the angle, but that''s a nit/photographer''s preference.  I like how it seems the gloved handed woman is attempting to help.  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(340890, 25242, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model - very good color and her motion is nicely stopped.  I don''t care for the background, but what could you do about it??  (no score affected)  I also don''t care for the stripe border as it''s lack of consistancy fades in and out more than I''d like to see.  (also no score, just mentioning it).  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Beautiful model - very good color and her motion is nicely stopped.  I don''t care for the background, but what could you do about it??  (no score affected)  I also don''t care for the stripe border as it''s lack of consistancy fades in and out more than I''d like to see.  (also no score, just mentioning it).  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(340891, 25845, 1005, '<td valign="top">So many issues, but I hate to be a complete downer......First, you cut both people by the crop, next I''m seeing a casino type lounge (more of a vacation scene) - an extended "break", third - the computer screens - nasty.  Color and focus are pretty good, include the bartender in the pic and I''d even accept the challenge aspect.  5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'So many issues, but I hate to be a complete downer......First, you cut both people by the crop, next I''m seeing a casino type lounge (more of a vacation scene) - an extended "break", third - the computer screens - nasty.  Color and focus are pretty good, include the bartender in the pic and I''d even accept the challenge aspect.  5 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(340895, 25906, 1005, '<td valign="top">A fine landscape/cityscape photo...including the canoe is a nice touch, as are the bushes in the foreground.  That said, this is a far reach for "At Work" (maybe near work?).  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'A fine landscape/cityscape photo...including the canoe is a nice touch, as are the bushes in the foreground.  That said, this is a far reach for "At Work" (maybe near work?).  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(340896, 25612, 1005, '<td valign="top">Crazy shot!  Micro-photography looks really, really hard.  The purple face is a cute touch.  The blood cells seem unclear.  Challenge-wise - it''s a bit of a stretch, but it is an interesting idea (a.k.a. not fully buying into it).  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Crazy shot!  Micro-photography looks really, really hard.  The purple face is a cute touch.  The blood cells seem unclear.  Challenge-wise - it''s a bit of a stretch, but it is an interesting idea (a.k.a. not fully buying into it).  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(340898, 25973, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo!  I''m not sure that this coloration works here...see how the edge of the roof melts into the sky?  Plus the shadow across the worker''s face hides quite a bit.  Challenge well met.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Sharp photo!  I''m not sure that this coloration works here...see how the edge of the roof melts into the sky?  Plus the shadow across the worker''s face hides quite a bit.  Challenge well met.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(340899, 25960, 1005, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like a great day for the beach.  Guard''s station looks very sharp, but the lifeguard is so dark (was it a bit windy?)  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Doesn''t look like a great day for the beach.  Guard''s station looks very sharp, but the lifeguard is so dark (was it a bit windy?)  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(340900, 25859, 1005, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''d want to stand out in front of those cars and taxis.  Some colors seem very true, while others are too exaggerated (like yellow).  The traffic cop''s facial features aren''t very distinct.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I don''t think I''d want to stand out in front of those cars and taxis.  Some colors seem very true, while others are too exaggerated (like yellow).  The traffic cop''s facial features aren''t very distinct.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(340902, 25924, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good color - focus seem pretty good.  Darn white shirt - very difficult in sunlight to not be blown out.  Too bad he isn''t looking more in our direction.  (Then again, do you want the POLICE staring at you??)  Background isn''t horrible, but a bit mixed.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Good color - focus seem pretty good.  Darn white shirt - very difficult in sunlight to not be blown out.  Too bad he isn''t looking more in our direction.  (Then again, do you want the POLICE staring at you??)  Background isn''t horrible, but a bit mixed.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(340903, 25976, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very representative of this challenge.  Excellent sharpness.  Lighting - just a tad dark, but I think I''m O.K. with that.  Nicely done!  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very representative of this challenge.  Excellent sharpness.  Lighting - just a tad dark, but I think I''m O.K. with that.  Nicely done!  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(340905, 25589, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the airplane!  To me, this seems more like "play" than work as these aircraft were retired several decades ago.  The people may be "working" in the sense of a flight demo or such....still it''s hard to call this "at work" (don''t worry, it''s not a huge score effect).  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Great shot of the airplane!  To me, this seems more like "play" than work as these aircraft were retired several decades ago.  The people may be "working" in the sense of a flight demo or such....still it''s hard to call this "at work" (don''t worry, it''s not a huge score effect).  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(340907, 25984, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good color and a very sharp, emotive photograph.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very good color and a very sharp, emotive photograph.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-27 20:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
