(341048, 25878, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice colors! These guys look like mannequins with those yellow suits on. Composition and colors make this photo work, though, of course, I''d love to see them in action! Nice. 8</td>', 'Nice colors! These guys look like mannequins with those yellow suits on. Composition and colors make this photo work, though, of course, I''d love to see them in action! Nice. 8', '2003-06-27 23:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
