(341181, 25973, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting angle and a good subject. The lighting bothers me a bit - the house/roof and the background seem to be the same shade, making it hard to tell what''s going on at the edges; and his face is heavily in shadow, which looks a bit awkward in a challenge that has me looking at the people.<br/> <br/>The composition of the photograph - the way the house is on an angle - works nicely, as does the close proximity of the two men, helping to keep focus on them.</td>', 'This is an interesting angle and a good subject. The lighting bothers me a bit - the house/roof and the background seem to be the same shade, making it hard to tell what''s going on at the edges; and his face is heavily in shadow, which looks a bit awkward in a challenge that has me looking at the people. The composition of the photograph - the way the house is on an angle - works nicely, as does the close proximity of the two men, helping to keep focus on them.', '2003-06-28 02:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(341182, 25950, 8911, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject - and I like the composition, except the white post in the background, which seems to be sprouting up almost out of the carving.</td>', 'An interesting subject - and I like the composition, except the white post in the background, which seems to be sprouting up almost out of the carving.', '2003-06-28 02:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(341237, 25589, 554, '<td valign="top">Is this a model?..... should be better focused to enter in a contest, model or real......does not give me the feeling these people are at work but rather at play....</td>', 'Is this a model?..... should be better focused to enter in a contest, model or real......does not give me the feeling these people are at work but rather at play....', '2003-06-28 09:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(341241, 25242, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the person, but the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good capture of the person, but the background is a bit distracting.', '2003-06-28 10:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(341303, 25327, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I''d like it better with different lighting, I think. As it is, my eye goes to the blank part of the paper (where the light hits it) and to the subject''s hair - rather than to his face or hand, or the writing, which are more shadowed.</td>', 'I like this, but I''d like it better with different lighting, I think. As it is, my eye goes to the blank part of the paper (where the light hits it) and to the subject''s hair - rather than to his face or hand, or the writing, which are more shadowed.', '2003-06-28 12:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(341311, 25892, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super composition wtih all of those interesting lines. I like not being able to see their faces. Nice work here.</td>', 'Super composition wtih all of those interesting lines. I like not being able to see their faces. Nice work here.', '2003-06-28 13:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(341318, 25960, 8911, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty beach. I think this picture could have been a lot stronger - the focus is a bit on the thin side (heavily underlined by the blurred words on the sign - and when I go searching for what is in focus, I can''t find it), and the life guard is so shadowed it''s hard to see details of his face (probably in part focus, but also the lighting there is overwhelmed by light off the water behind him).<br/> <br/>It might have been worth playing with a sharping mask or trying to get a clearer shot to start from, and lightening it a little (although the difference between the lifeguard and the tower he''s sitting on might have made that difficult to do without making the structure glare).</td>', 'It''s a pretty beach. I think this picture could have been a lot stronger - the focus is a bit on the thin side (heavily underlined by the blurred words on the sign - and when I go searching for what is in focus, I can''t find it), and the life guard is so shadowed it''s hard to see details of his face (probably in part focus, but also the lighting there is overwhelmed by light off the water behind him). It might have been worth playing with a sharping mask or trying to get a clearer shot to start from, and lightening it a little (although the difference between the lifeguard and the tower he''s sitting on might have made that difficult to do without making the structure glare).', '2003-06-28 13:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(341320, 25859, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the subject - it seems like the background is too in-focus, possibly more so than the subject, and because it''s so busy it''s very distracting.</td>', 'I like the subject - it seems like the background is too in-focus, possibly more so than the subject, and because it''s so busy it''s very distracting.', '2003-06-28 13:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(341321, 25825, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this one - the angle chosen is creative, and the picture is nicely held by the horse''s head and the man''s head. His hat glows a little, but I''m impressed that his face is as clear as it is under that.</td>', 'I like this one - the angle chosen is creative, and the picture is nicely held by the horse''s head and the man''s head. His hat glows a little, but I''m impressed that his face is as clear as it is under that.', '2003-06-28 13:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(341322, 25882, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of motion - very crisp. I like the way you''ve given a portion of the picture over to the dust, so that the eye tracks along the same path he followed to the base.</td>', 'Nice capture of motion - very crisp. I like the way you''ve given a portion of the picture over to the dust, so that the eye tracks along the same path he followed to the base.', '2003-06-28 13:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(341323, 25984, 8911, '<td valign="top">Very powerful - painful to look at in the way that a good photo of this sort should be. I like the way you''ve cropped it close, letting her take over the shot - that, and the plain wall, makes a very stark shot, very well-done.</td>', 'Very powerful - painful to look at in the way that a good photo of this sort should be. I like the way you''ve cropped it close, letting her take over the shot - that, and the plain wall, makes a very stark shot, very well-done.', '2003-06-28 13:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(341324, 25961, 8911, '<td valign="top">Hopefully this is not a standard study mode when there''s a camera not involved. The setup is great and very good for a laugh, though. Nice control of focus - I like the fact that her face is crisp and clear, but I can still read the text on all the books.</td>', 'Hopefully this is not a standard study mode when there''s a camera not involved. The setup is great and very good for a laugh, though. Nice control of focus - I like the fact that her face is crisp and clear, but I can still read the text on all the books.', '2003-06-28 13:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(341326, 25425, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy scene - distractingly so. The lights (is that what they are?) draw my eyes away from the workers, 2 of whom are solidly in shadow and harm to make out in any case. I wonder if it could have been tightened in with a smaller crop, perhaps around the one person who is clearly-lit, at the end of the conveyer.</td>', 'This is a very busy scene - distractingly so. The lights (is that what they are?) draw my eyes away from the workers, 2 of whom are solidly in shadow and harm to make out in any case. I wonder if it could have been tightened in with a smaller crop, perhaps around the one person who is clearly-lit, at the end of the conveyer.', '2003-06-28 13:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
