(341578, 25827, 6900, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  Scary image.</td>', 'Yikes!  Scary image.', '2003-06-29 00:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(341580, 25906, 6900, '<td valign="top">Lots of people work in those buildings.  I don''t see that this meets the challenge, though.</td>', 'Lots of people work in those buildings.  I don''t see that this meets the challenge, though.', '2003-06-29 00:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(341581, 25821, 6900, '<td valign="top">The at work person is so small in this frame that it''s hard to even find him.  Good sky color and detail in the shadows.</td>', 'The at work person is so small in this frame that it''s hard to even find him.  Good sky color and detail in the shadows.', '2003-06-29 00:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(341583, 25425, 6900, '<td valign="top">Each person is so small in the frame that it''s hard to see what is the main subject.  This is a very busy shot.  The white sky is difficult to deal with and overpowering, as well.</td>', 'Each person is so small in the frame that it''s hard to see what is the main subject.  This is a very busy shot.  The white sky is difficult to deal with and overpowering, as well.', '2003-06-29 00:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(341584, 25589, 6900, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast, perhaps a different sky color with a hue shift - the whole image has a rather blue cast to it.</td>', 'Needs more contrast, perhaps a different sky color with a hue shift - the whole image has a rather blue cast to it.', '2003-06-29 00:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(341585, 25587, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting twosome to be having a chat.  I think that the crop is a bit too tight and I wish i could read the "Hit and Run Victim''s Anguish at....." WHAT?!  :)</td>', 'Interesting twosome to be having a chat.  I think that the crop is a bit too tight and I wish i could read the "Hit and Run Victim''s Anguish at....." WHAT?!  :)', '2003-06-29 00:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(341586, 25763, 6900, '<td valign="top">Looks like you called it a dress.  Question - why the high socks? :)  Also - who has the shorter skirt here?</td>', 'Looks like you called it a dress.  Question - why the high socks? :)  Also - who has the shorter skirt here?', '2003-06-29 00:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(341588, 25953, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but it probly needs more contrast.  I wish we weren''t seeing the back of this guy and I am not sure where my eye should go.</td>', 'Interesting shot but it probly needs more contrast.  I wish we weren''t seeing the back of this guy and I am not sure where my eye should go.', '2003-06-29 00:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(341590, 25982, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice toning but the radio is distracting and the composition isn''t as interesting to me as it must have been to you.</td>', 'Nice toning but the radio is distracting and the composition isn''t as interesting to me as it must have been to you.', '2003-06-29 00:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(341591, 25602, 6900, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t he be looking at the tube, not you?  I like the overall composition, but the colors look weird.</td>', 'Shouldn''t he be looking at the tube, not you?  I like the overall composition, but the colors look weird.', '2003-06-29 00:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(341593, 25389, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I wish we had either a tighter crop or a different perspective here though.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I wish we had either a tighter crop or a different perspective here though.', '2003-06-29 00:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(341594, 25719, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great look on his face.  I don''t like the tones here very much, but I like the overall shot.</td>', 'Great look on his face.  I don''t like the tones here very much, but I like the overall shot.', '2003-06-29 00:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(341662, 25845, 1031, '<td valign="top">Did you shoot this in an overhead mirror or gain access to an upper floor?</td>', 'Did you shoot this in an overhead mirror or gain access to an upper floor?', '2003-06-29 04:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(341668, 25882, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice action capture, ok positioning, good color. great overall look</td>', 'Nice action capture, ok positioning, good color. great overall look', '2003-06-29 05:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(341669, 25960, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good theme, could be better resolution, ok color, very nice overall. I like it</td>', 'Nice composition, good theme, could be better resolution, ok color, very nice overall. I like it', '2003-06-29 05:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(341670, 25973, 9668, '<td valign="top">sure looks like a hot job</td>', 'sure looks like a hot job', '2003-06-29 05:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(341811, 25984, 6064, '<td valign="top">IMHO it would of been better if the whole of the hands was shown.</td>', 'IMHO it would of been better if the whole of the hands was shown.', '2003-06-29 14:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(341820, 25080, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great image! One of my favorites in this challenge. Love the motion blur. Nice interpretation of "work", but is that really how she makes a living? :-)</td>', 'Great image! One of my favorites in this challenge. Love the motion blur. Nice interpretation of "work", but is that really how she makes a living? :-)', '2003-06-29 14:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(341821, 25434, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Makes me want to see more of the "scene".</td>', 'Nice shot. Makes me want to see more of the "scene".', '2003-06-29 14:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(341824, 25602, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great "at work" idea. Just wish the doc''s face was lit a little better and the noise wasn''t so pronounced in certain places (underside of gloves for example)</td>', 'Great "at work" idea. Just wish the doc''s face was lit a little better and the noise wasn''t so pronounced in certain places (underside of gloves for example)', '2003-06-29 14:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(341825, 25475, 7711, '<td valign="top">the fence is a bit distracting, but I like it, its subtle. I like that the machine frames the worker too.</td>', 'the fence is a bit distracting, but I like it, its subtle. I like that the machine frames the worker too.', '2003-06-29 14:42:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(341826, 25511, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and clarity, you certainly get the feeling of these guys "working" in your photo. The "tilted" yellow truck is the one thing that bothers me.</td>', 'Nice colors and clarity, you certainly get the feeling of these guys "working" in your photo. The "tilted" yellow truck is the one thing that bothers me.', '2003-06-29 14:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(341828, 25851, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love the spotlight, that we can only see all of her (head, shoulders, etc) in the shadow on the wall, its wild. That is such a fabulous shadow!! The grain is perfect.</td>', 'I love the spotlight, that we can only see all of her (head, shoulders, etc) in the shadow on the wall, its wild. That is such a fabulous shadow!! The grain is perfect.', '2003-06-29 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(341829, 25955, 8159, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this shot captures people doing what they do to "make a living". But I''ll assume they are. My critique is that the fence is in focus, and the subjects behind the fence are not. Good time to switch to manual focus if you can. Also, an "action" shot of the game in progress might have made for a more interesting picture.</td>', 'Not sure if this shot captures people doing what they do to "make a living". But I''ll assume they are. My critique is that the fence is in focus, and the subjects behind the fence are not. Good time to switch to manual focus if you can. Also, an "action" shot of the game in progress might have made for a more interesting picture.', '2003-06-29 14:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(341833, 25970, 8159, '<td valign="top">One of my higher ranked photos for this challenge. I like the colors and subject matter. I only wish the guys in the photo were actually handling some of their "catch" instead of chatting.</td>', 'One of my higher ranked photos for this challenge. I like the colors and subject matter. I only wish the guys in the photo were actually handling some of their "catch" instead of chatting.', '2003-06-29 14:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(341836, 25612, 8159, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but I had to mark you down because the challenge said "Photograph a person or group of people". Otherwise, neat shot.</td>', 'Cute idea, but I had to mark you down because the challenge said "Photograph a person or group of people". Otherwise, neat shot.', '2003-06-29 14:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(341837, 25613, 7711, '<td valign="top">I think the black border is a bit heavy but it matches the heavy shadows on the tracks. The perspective makes your subject look small and isolated, which really works for this shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'I think the black border is a bit heavy but it matches the heavy shadows on the tracks. The perspective makes your subject look small and isolated, which really works for this shot. Nicely done.', '2003-06-29 14:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(341838, 25906, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice Toronto skyline... but I had to give a below average vote because the challenge said "Photograph a person or group of people doing whatever they do to make their living", and I don''t think the people in the canoe are making a living. If they are, my apologies.</td>', 'Nice Toronto skyline... but I had to give a below average vote because the challenge said "Photograph a person or group of people doing whatever they do to make their living", and I don''t think the people in the canoe are making a living. If they are, my apologies.', '2003-06-29 14:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(341839, 25970, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love the colours of this shot. The gorgeous blue sky contrasts well with the details on the boats and the fishermen pants.</td>', 'I love the colours of this shot. The gorgeous blue sky contrasts well with the details on the boats and the fishermen pants.', '2003-06-29 15:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(341843, 25242, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love the  movement shown in her hair and body. I wish the background was plain, but you take what you can get!</td>', 'I love the  movement shown in her hair and body. I wish the background was plain, but you take what you can get!', '2003-06-29 15:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(341848, 25976, 9714, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  It is simple, yet gives a clear view to the working hands of a laborer.</td>', 'I love this photo.  It is simple, yet gives a clear view to the working hands of a laborer.', '2003-06-29 15:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(341861, 25976, 7711, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t improve this if my life depended on it. I think the lighting is inspired, the detail of the grease on his hands is amazing, full of emotion. None of the background details are distracting either. I absolutely love this. 10</td>', 'I couldn''t improve this if my life depended on it. I think the lighting is inspired, the detail of the grease on his hands is amazing, full of emotion. None of the background details are distracting either. I absolutely love this. 10', '2003-06-29 15:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(341868, 25962, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice use of long exposure to get the "neon looking" motion blur. Really like how the guitarists face is "recognizable" and not just a blur. I assume you used a flash during the long exposure to achieve that effect? Well done.</td>', 'Nice use of long exposure to get the "neon looking" motion blur. Really like how the guitarists face is "recognizable" and not just a blur. I assume you used a flash during the long exposure to achieve that effect? Well done.', '2003-06-29 15:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(341871, 25871, 8159, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter. Wish the background was exposed better so you could see all the tools and things on the wall. Alternatively, might have considered cropping to a vertical format centered around the guy working. I know lighting in a situation like this is tricky.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter. Wish the background was exposed better so you could see all the tools and things on the wall. Alternatively, might have considered cropping to a vertical format centered around the guy working. I know lighting in a situation like this is tricky.', '2003-06-29 16:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(341876, 25821, 8159, '<td valign="top">Wish there was more "person" and less "structure" in the shot. Great subject matter, but the person in it is deep in the shadows. Also, it might help to "anchor" the structure better if the vertical lines were straight up and down instead of "tilting over". Not knowing what the entire structure looks like, this may not be possible or even "correct", but it looks like it is tilting to the right. Good job of capturing somebody "at work" though.</td>', 'Wish there was more "person" and less "structure" in the shot. Great subject matter, but the person in it is deep in the shadows. Also, it might help to "anchor" the structure better if the vertical lines were straight up and down instead of "tilting over". Not knowing what the entire structure looks like, this may not be possible or even "correct", but it looks like it is tilting to the right. Good job of capturing somebody "at work" though.', '2003-06-29 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(341878, 25875, 8159, '<td valign="top">Tip: try to get your picture to the maximum dimensions (640 pixels) for the next challenge. As for this shot, the faces on the people "working" are underexposed or deep in shadow, and I think it would have been nice to see their faces to give some character to the photo. The subject matter has a lot of potential.</td>', 'Tip: try to get your picture to the maximum dimensions (640 pixels) for the next challenge. As for this shot, the faces on the people "working" are underexposed or deep in shadow, and I think it would have been nice to see their faces to give some character to the photo. The subject matter has a lot of potential.', '2003-06-29 16:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(341903, 25958, 1031, '<td valign="top">I sense there''s more than one "challenge" involved in this shot ... I look forward to reading more about it.</td>', 'I sense there''s more than one "challenge" involved in this shot ... I look forward to reading more about it.', '2003-06-29 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(341915, 25602, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, one of the best this week I think. The face is a bit dark though, 9.</td>', 'Very nice photo, one of the best this week I think. The face is a bit dark though, 9.', '2003-06-29 19:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
