(532833, 25892, 15703, '<td valign="top">Excellent. I suppose being a Scot, you have to be expert in making dull / grey / dull &amp; grey look fab. Without a Porsche, "classy lady" or Hawaiian sunset, workaday scenes like this have to be really good to make viewers pause. And this one stopped me long enough to leave a comment!  Gorgeously even background, too.</td>', 'Excellent. I suppose being a Scot, you have to be expert in making dull / grey / dull & grey look fab. Without a Porsche, "classy lady" or Hawaiian sunset, workaday scenes like this have to be really good to make viewers pause. And this one stopped me long enough to leave a comment!  Gorgeously even background, too.', '2004-01-05 19:05:33.000000', NULL, 0),
