(788350, 25984, 7350, '<td valign="top">I really love the mood of this shot.  The colors are great, and the expression on the woman''s face is priceless.  My favorite part is that you cropped out part of her hand - it makes me feel like I''m in the scene, and she''s asking me personally for a handout.  Great shot!</td>', 'I really love the mood of this shot.  The colors are great, and the expression on the woman''s face is priceless.  My favorite part is that you cropped out part of her hand - it makes me feel like I''m in the scene, and she''s asking me personally for a handout.  Great shot!', '2004-06-30 23:14:46.000000', NULL, 0),
