(1679530, 25984, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is such a moving image - and then when I read your own comments about the photo, I almost cried. It''s amazing how long it sometime takes us to really notice other human beings around us. Thanks for letting so many of us see and think about this. Very well done!</td>', 'This is such a moving image - and then when I read your own comments about the photo, I almost cried. It''s amazing how long it sometime takes us to really notice other human beings around us. Thanks for letting so many of us see and think about this. Very well done!', '2005-09-06 17:11:55.000000', NULL, 0),
